7.710" end="01:58.280">this </span><span begin="01:58.280" end="01:59.240">awful </span><span begin="01:59.240" end="02:00.170">energy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.170" end="02:04.160"><span begin="02:00.170" end="02:00.710">God </span><span begin="02:00.710" end="02:01.100">damn </span><span begin="02:01.100" end="02:01.670">right</span><span begin="02:01.670" end="02:01.700">, </span><span begin="02:01.700" end="02:02.030">you </span><span begin="02:02.030" end="02:02.720">should </span><span begin="02:02.720" end="02:03.020">be </span><span begin="02:03.020" end="02:03.590">scared </span><span begin="02:03.590" end="02:03.710">of </span><span begin="02:03.710" end="02:04.160">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.190" end="02:08.060"><span begin="02:04.190" end="02:04.790">Who </span><span begin="02:04.790" end="02:05.120">is </span><span begin="02:05.120" end="02:05.720">in </span><span begin="02:05.720" end="02:07.880">control</span><span begin="02:07.880" end="02:08.060">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.060" end="02:12.650"><span begin="02:08.060" end="02:08.180">Well</span><span begin="02:08.180" end="02:08.210">, </span><span begin="02:08.210" end="02:08.600">I'm </span><span begin="02:08.600" end="02:09.080">well </span><span begin="02:09.080" end="02:10.010">acquainted </span><span begin="02:10.010" end="02:10.250">with </span><span begin="02:10.250" end="02:11.030">villains </span><span begin="02:11.030" end="02:11.240">that </span><span begin="02:11.240" end="02:11.720">live </span><span begin="02:11.720" end="02:11.930">in </span><span begin="02:11.930" end="02:12.200">my </span><span begin="02:12.200" end="02:12.650">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.860" end="02:22.550"><span begin="02:15.860" end="02:16.130">They </span><span begin="02:16.130" end="02:16.580">beg </span><span begin="02:16.580" end="02:16.880">me </span><span begin="02:16.880" end="02:17.210">to </span><span begin="02:17.210" end="02:17.600">wri